  "prefLabel": "Ve-H 306.03 Effect of Signature on Page One-A of the Application",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-12-26",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ve-H 306.03 Effect of Signature on Page One-A of the Application. The witnessed signature on page one-A of the application shall constitute the applicant's verification that the information entered on pages one and one-A is true to the best of the applicant's knowledge and belief.\n\nSource. #8953, eff 7-21-07, EXPIRED: 7-21-15\n\nNew. #12564, INTERIM, eff 6-28-18, EXPIRED: 12-26-18\n\nNew. #12712, eff 1-15-19",
